 "final_summary": "The bug was caused by incomplete validation of unknown fields in task creation. The fix removes unnecessary field exclusions from the unknown field check, ensuring all fields not in TASK_FIELDS are rejected with a 422 error. This prevents invalid input from being accepted and ensures proper input validation.",
